### ADMIN only: create a staff account (role: ADMIN, DOCTOR, NURSE or BILLING_STAFF)
POST http://localhost:4004/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer <admin-access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dr.example@pms.test",
  "password": "<12-to-72-character-password>",
  "role": "DOCTOR"
}

###
